data-tex=\"\\doteq\">\\(\\doteq\\)</span> 的排印别名，而非另一个关系符号。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}language} \\vdash L(S) \\coloneqq (\\mathrm{Var}, \\mathrm{Const}_S, \\mathrm{Func}_S, \\mathrm{Rel}_S, \\{\\neg, \\land, \\lor, \\to, \\leftrightarrow, \\forall, \\exists, \\equiv\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}language} \\vdash L(S) \\coloneqq (\\mathrm{Var}, \\mathrm{Const}_S, \\mathrm{Func}_S, \\mathrm{Rel}_S, \\{\\neg, \\land, \\lor, \\to, \\leftrightarrow, \\forall, \\exists, \\equiv\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-arity","status":"resolved","id":"b55affe36ee4719a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-arity]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-arity","status":"resolved","id":"b55affe36ee4719a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ (签名, see [[57-df-arity]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{Const}_S,\\mathrm{Func}_S,\\mathrm{Rel}_S$ 是 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]] 的固定分量；显示中的 $\\equiv$ 是等号字母 $\\doteq$ 的排印别名，而非另一个关系符号。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{Const}_S,\\mathrm{Func}_S,\\mathrm{Rel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv","display":false},{"tex":"\\doteq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}language} \\vdash L(S) \\coloneqq (\\mathrm{Var}, \\mathrm{Const}_S, \\mathrm{Func}_S, \\mathrm{Rel}_S, \\{\\neg, \\land, \\lor, \\to, \\leftrightarrow, \\forall, \\exists, \\equiv\\})","display":true}],"bytes":809,"backlinks":[{"id":"ff975959db7c0c83","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[57-df-first-order-language]] 的字母表，$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S$，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$。$\\preceq$ 取 [[57-df-elementary-substructure]]；$|\\mathfrak B|$ 表示载体，$\\bigl||\\mathfrak B|\\bigr|$ 表示其基数，见 [[57-df-structure]]。"},{"id":"7aafa519603f2c09","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[57-df-first-order-language]] 的字母表，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$；$\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)$，见 [[57-df-cardinal]]。量化结构均属于 $\\mathrm{Struct}_S$；$\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|$ 是载体的基数，见 [[57-df-structure]]。"},{"id":"c3641f7a442206b5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4829220d0330e683","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为 [[57-df-first-order-language]] 的字母表；$I=\\mathrm{Func}(S)$ 取 [[57-df-function]]，只含正元函数符号；$n_i=\\mathrm{arity}(i)$ 取 [[57-df-arity]]。\n$F$ 是候选抽象载体，$g$ 是定义域为 $I$ 的候选运算族，$\\mathfrak F_S=\\langle F,g\\rangle$；不预设 $F=\\mathrm{Fml}_S$。$\\mathrm{FV}$ 是显式固定的候选支持映射，其定义域包含当前候选载体且 $\\mathrm{FV}(p)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}$；$F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 时采用 [[57-df-free-variable]] 的映射。该支持映射为本谓词的固定环境参数。$f_i^{\\mathfrak F}$ 和 $|\\mathfrak F_S|$ 使用下式的相应投影接口。"},{"id":"373da07803c26744","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为 [[57-df-first-order-language]] 的签名；$\\mathrm{Fml}_L,\\mathrm{Term}_L$ 见 [[57-df-formula]]、[[57-df-term]]。假定表达式集至多可数。$g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ 是待选的单射编码，$\\mathrm{GN}_{57}(g,L)$ 为本文件的编码条件。$\\mathrm{PR}$ 仍为 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]] 的数值函数类；$\\chi_E$ 是自然数集合 $E$ 的总特征函数。"},{"id":"384c24ae38b35244","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f299cb3aecfed079","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$S$ (签名, see [[57-df-first-order-language]])"},{"id":"f4c7cfc2c8937175","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ (签名, see [[57-df-first-order-language]])"},{"id":"5c06742bc27c04ba","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9c053a73bd2d84c4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ (签名, see [[57-df-first-order-language]])"},{"id":"5fa79c8e3fa53370","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2d8f5002c4256603","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"43ca2d9b7fc5df00","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"96557e0d89e19386","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"07b70d655c173ad1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dcb60b5afbc9cde8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"92dd6bddd7394a4d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"745fc0c979c72f17","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5d4e38b5fc56856c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e4d9ab0f9e9545c9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7e46eab7508a86c4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0df613e30f0e3f59","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"537b8a526b8d31ce","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ (签名, see [[57-df-first-order-language]])"},{"id":